linux-trackpad-driver (0.1.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Terminate virtual contacts on source loss and smooth pointer motion.
  * Replace pump polling with event-driven idle and bound haptic queue.
  * Harden socket lifecycle, activation contract, and service sandboxing.
  * Fix Bluetooth udev matching, config selection, and doctor validation.

